{"fields":[{"t":"B","v":"true","n":"HasIntroAudio"},{"t":"A","v":"intro","n":"IntroAudio","s":"Is this next question hard? Or simply an illusion?"},{"t":"B","v":"true","n":"HasPromptAudio"},{"t":"A","v":"prompt","n":"PromptAudio","s":"Les 8 jolis pays commençant par la lettre I"},{"t":"B","v":"true","n":"HasClueAudio0"},{"t":"A","v":"answers_0_hint","n":"ClueAudio0","s":"You know, like the Dickens character?"},{"t":"B","v":"true","n":"HasClueAudio1"},{"t":"A","v":"answers_1_hint","n":"ClueAudio1","s":"They had the tigers! The magical tigers"},{"t":"B","v":"false","n":"HasClueAudio2"},{"t":"A","v":"answers_2_hint","n":"ClueAudio2"},{"t":"B","v":"false","n":"HasClueAudio3"},{"t":"A","v":"answers_3_hint","n":"ClueAudio3"},{"t":"B","v":"true","n":"HasClueAudio4"},{"t":"A","v":"answers_4_hint","n":"ClueAudio4","s":"There's just something magical about their height difference."},{"t":"B","v":"true","n":"HasClueAudio5"},{"t":"A","v":"answers_5_hint","n":"ClueAudio5","s":"You know, the bad boy of magic?"},{"t":"B","v":"true","n":"HasClueAudio6"},{"t":"A","v":"answers_6_hint","n":"ClueAudio6","s":"The man who started it all, if by “it” you mean drowning yourself while wearing handcuffs."},{"t":"B","v":"true","n":"HasClueAudio7"},{"t":"A","v":"answers_7_hint","n":"ClueAudio7","s":"Oh, what about that guy who was sealed high in a box for 44 days? That was pretty magical."},{"t":"B","v":"false","n":"HasFollowupAudio"},{"t":"A","v":"followup","n":"FollowupAudio"},{"t":"B","v":"true","n":"HasOutroAudio"},{"t":"A","v":"outro","n":"OutroAudio","s":"Did you know David Blaine is just a few years younger than me? He spent the entire Crusades showing me card tricks. It was abysmal."}]}
